                    "id": "700220203",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "<color=#00E1FFFF>Unta mosi dada</color>... Paimon lembra que isso significa... Uh... Umm...",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "700220204",
                            "text": "Mosi mita dada!",
                            "response": [
                                {
